["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">行</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>行（行进）；进行；行（行列）；行（银行）；行（行为）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ・ギョウ・アン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">い.く・ゆ.く・-ゆ.き・-ゆき・-い.き・-いき・おこな.う・おこ.なう</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">行く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">去</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">銀行</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎんこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">银行</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">旅行</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りょこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">旅行</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">見</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>看；看见；显示；意见；机会</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">み.る・み.える・み.せる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">見る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">看</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">見せる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みせる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">展示；显示；使……看起来……；呈现……的样子；使（场面等）值得一看；精彩演出；让（专家）鉴定；请人评估（古董等）；让（医生）诊视；带（伤者、患者等）就医；做出……的样子；以显眼的方式做；当众做；下定决心做；不惜一切地做；向他人表明自己会做</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">意見</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">意见</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">分</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/kanji/\">N5</a>分开；部分；分配；理解；分